{
	"name": "Memory Potion",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/commodities/biological/organ-brain-pink.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Anyone using one of your potions can apply it to a weapon or food as a bonus action. Applying a potion to an unwilling target requires you to grapple with, or successfully grab on, your target, but allows you to use an action to force-feed the target on a failed Constitution save.</p><p>A creature who consumes a potion of memory must make a Constitution save or be stunned for 1 round. For the next minute all knowledge checks are made with expertise.</p>",
